tus":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:07814263cf2511aa7548c6f0","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/a9658df751f28a45f7a673cfdccafa485ccd7a33258721ba03cbc31e1d05049b.json","sha256":"a093fd3a8b1e4b47a8d800510c1a377221bf0996a8cc0b930c92037d83834062"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-791/explanation_01.png","sha256":"db7a4e5ed10074532fbff2433652a8e24d8f2ec6c110014f6c82a2d296af7478"}],"text":""},"source:10625a053371ec1028ec9cbb":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["矩阵秩的定义与计算"],"metadata":{},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:10625a053371ec1028ec9cbb","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-566_矩阵秩的定义与计算.md","sha256":"6279280700f9fbdf33fc04403d4ca47bcd220c8d3adeeb0daa9a3c4894e2eb0e"}],"text":"# 矩阵秩的定义与计算\n\n本页是由五份讲义来源提炼的通用知识锚点，不含本人作答证据；关联题只表示知识点归属，不推断错因、掌握度或复习状态。\n\n## 范围\n\n由最高阶非零子式或行阶梯形非零行数求秩；对参数导致的主元消失分类。\n\n## 条件与边界\n\n某个r阶子式非零只给下界；证明恰为r还需上界或全体高阶子式信息。\n\n## 来源\n\n| 来源 | 文件 | PDF页 | 书内页 | 定位短语 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ZY-L | 《2026 张宇线性 9讲》.pdf | 50–51 | 40–41 | 定义 |\n| L880 | 【A4紧凑版】880数一线概篇做题本.pdf | 8 | 7 | 等价 |\n\n## 上级知识节点\n\n- 矩阵秩（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n- prerequisite → LA05.05：建议的学习／调用前置，不是逻辑充分条件；允许其他学习顺序。\n- prerequisite → LA04.02：建议的学习／调用前置，不是逻辑充分条件；允许其他学习顺序。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`LA04.01`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:20cc47ccee403db3be112ed7":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"accepted_capture_reference","labels":["多元函数积分学","平面图形面积","曲线积分","有向边界","格林公式","第二型曲线积分"],"metadata":{"capture_ids":["MFI-CAP-9e7ef180f29a82ada8345ce2"],"closeout_id":"MFI-CLOSE-02c31dc0188ad97ae78237ca","conversation_complete":false,"conversation_status":"legacy_conversation_missing","coverage":"full_bytes"